<title>PHILIPPINES: Piltel 1996 net at 710.468 mln pesos.</title>
<headline>Piltel 1996 net at 710.468 mln pesos.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cellular phone company Pilipino Telephone Corporation (Piltel) said on Wednesday it posted a net income of 710.468 million pesos in 1996 against 822.075 million pesos in the previous year.</p>
<p>In a disclosure to the Securities and Exchange Commission (SEC), Piltel said its fully diluted earnings per share in 1996 was at 0.56 pesos compared with 0.89 pesos in 1995.</p>
</text>
